              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andû arîa onthe maatûûraga Jerusalemu nîmegwire ûvoro ûcio, na kwoguo na rûthiomi rwao metaga mûgûnda ûcio Akelidama, naguo ûguo nîta kuga mûgûnda wa nthakame.”)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.19"
            ]
          }
        }
